{"bookId":"cp-2","editionId":"6879da4e6ec271ab","chapterId":"c0065","paragraphs":[{"id":"p3c554cacd926-1","text":"小雨廉纤风细细。"},{"id":"p86eeb4be1a41-1","text":"万家杨柳轻烟里。"},{"id":"p6106e5bfdf9b-1","text":"恋树湿花飞不起。"},{"id":"p77e0c1bc12a0-1","text":"愁无比。"},{"id":"pacd5c475f49d-1","text":"和春付与西流水。"},{"id":"pfbe98157f0e7-1","text":"九十光阴能有几。"},{"id":"pa59079976b43-1","text":"金龟解尽留无计。"},{"id":"pe39eb66b99ee-1","text":"寄语东城沽酒市。"},{"id":"p2ab85a9e17dd-1","text":"拼一醉。"},{"id":"p76c3fb8660a6-1","text":"而今乐事他年泪。"}]}